      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Assistant\nFrom the wiki page [[Region X / Infrastructure]]:\nThree studies report transformer capacity at 1.4 GW [c12],\n1.6 GW [c14], and 1.5 GW [c17] respectively.\nThe [[Region X / Infrastructure]] page notes Finding F12 \u2014 a\nconflict between [[Source:S3]] and [[Source:S7]]. Open\nthe wiki tab or click any [[wikilink]] to navigate.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assistant\nFrom the wiki page [[Region X / Infrastructure]]:\nThree studies report transformer capacity at 1.4 GW [c12],\n1.6 GW [c14], and 1.5 GW [c17] respectively.\nThe [[Region X / Infrastructure]] page notes Finding F12 \u2014 a\nconflict between [[Source:S3]] and [[Source:S7]]. Open\nthe wiki tab or click any [[wikilink]] to navigate.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
