      "text": "Transformer capacity in the regional grid\nhas been characterised in three independent\nstudies. [c12] reports 1.4 GW peak supply,\n[c14] cites 1.6 GW, and [c17] derives 1.5 GW\nfrom a different model.\n\nCross-references: [[Region X / Power Demand]],\n[[Transformer]], [[Source:S3]], [[Source:S7]].\n\n\u25b2 Finding F12 \u2014 citation conflict between\n[[Source:S3]] and [[Source:S7]]. See Briefs.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transformer capacity in the regional grid\nhas been characterised in three independent\nstudies. [c12] reports 1.4 GW peak supply,\n[c14] cites 1.6 GW, and [c17] derives 1.5 GW\nfrom a different model.\n\nCross-references: [[Region X / Power Demand]],\n[[Transformer]], [[Source:S3]], [[Source:S7]].\n\n\u25b2 Finding F12 \u2014 citation conflict between\n[[Source:S3]] and [[Source:S7]]. See Briefs.",
